{"id":"d09902009c3b686f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal.md","title":"Feferman-Schutte Ordinal","display":"df-feferman-schutte-ordinal — Feferman-Schutte Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","aliases":["72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal"],"display":"df-feferman-schutte-ordinal — Feferman-Schutte Ordinal","depends_on":["[[72-df-veblen-function]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.1; print267–268; PDF279–280","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-feferman-schutte-ordinal — Feferman-Schutte Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d42a84e97b1092e\" href=\"?note=6d42a84e97b1092e\" title=\"72-df-veblen-function\">72-df-veblen-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.1; print267–268; PDF279–280"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)\">\\(\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d42a84e97b1092e\" href=\"?note=6d42a84e97b1092e\" title=\"72-df-veblen-function\">72-df-veblen-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 由以下显示式引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_0:=1,\\qquad\\gamma_{n+1}:=\\varphi_{\\gamma_n}(0),\\qquad\\Gamma_0:=\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\gamma_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma_0:=1,\\qquad\\gamma_{n+1}:=\\varphi_{\\gamma_n}(0),\\qquad\\Gamma_0:=\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\gamma_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:0&lt;\\alpha\\land\\varphi_\\alpha(0)=\\alpha\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_0=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:0&lt;\\alpha\\land\\varphi_\\alpha(0)=\\alpha\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第 IV 章 §3.1，印刷 pp.267–268 / PDF pp.279–280 的首个强临界数。对任意ξ&lt;Γ0，取n使ξ&lt;γn，则γn+1是φξ的不动点；连续性给φξ(Γ0)=Γ0，所以Γ0在全部较低层的不动点类中。若该类最小元δ小于Γ0，取γn&gt;δ，则δ是φγn的不动点，故γn+1=φγn(0)≤δ，与γn+1≥γn&gt;δ矛盾。因此Γ0就是该类最小元，φΓ0(0)=Γ0。任何正对角不动点α按归纳界住全部γn，故Γ0≤α；因此显示的最小值表征成立。φ1(0)=ε0，并不是Γ0。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-veblen-function","status":"resolved","id":"6d42a84e97b1092e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veblen-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-veblen-function","status":"resolved","id":"6d42a84e97b1092e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)$ 见 [[72-df-veblen-function]]，$n\\in\\omega$；$\\gamma$ 和 $\\Gamma_0$ 由以下显示式引入。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma_0:=1,\\qquad\\gamma_{n+1}:=\\varphi_{\\gamma_n}(0),\\qquad\\Gamma_0:=\\sup_{n\\in\\omega}\\gamma_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:0<\\alpha\\land\\varphi_\\alpha(0)=\\alpha\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1478,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal|df-feferman-schutte-ordinal — Feferman-Schutte Ordinal]]"},{"id":"a7f12f5d72018cbe","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma_0$ is the Feferman--Schütte ordinal defined in [[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]"},{"id":"f37fed96637e692d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 约定适用的理论，$\\Gamma_0$ 取 [[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。下式限定为Pohlers本书IV§3.1明确声明的技术用语，下标P98是该限定的一部分。"},{"id":"358c7e197917c7a7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 约定适用的理论，$\\Gamma_0$ 取 [[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。下式限定为Pohlers本书IV§3.1明确声明的技术用语，下标P98是该限定的一部分。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal|df-feferman-schutte-ordinal — Feferman-Schutte Ordinal]]"},{"id":"5f74371081322951","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma_0$为[[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]的首个正Veblen对角不动点。序数按von Neumann集合解释，$\\beta\\in\\Gamma_0$等价于$\\beta<\\Gamma_0$。"},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641c